1
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:39,600
What has upset Your Excellency?

2
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:41,600
The books are strewn
all over the floor

3
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:44,200
You're just the person!

4
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:47,200
Didn't you want to do your part
for this town?

5
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:50,400
I have just the assignment for you!

6
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:55,200
Your Excellency, nothing in this town
is too difficult for me

7
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,200
What is it regarding,
Your Excellency?

8
00:01:58,200 --> 00:02:02,600
I want the peach blossoms in full
bloom and I want it done pronto!

9
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:04,600
Peach blossoms in bloom?

10
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:09,400
Your Excellency, the peach blossoms
bloom in the 2nd and 3rd months

11
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:11,600
Why the urgency, Your Excellency?

12
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:15,600
My task is to have peach blossoms
in full bloom right away

13
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:17,800
Why else did I seek your help?

14
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:21,200
But the weather is too cold for
peach blossoms to bloom

15
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:24,200
Think of something then!
Don't just stand there

16
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:27,400
There is a time and season
for everything

17
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:32,200
The laws of nature prevail. Tell me
what I should do, Your Excellency

18
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:35,600
You've just claimed
nothing is too difficult for you

19
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:38,800
But you back off the moment
you're posed with a challenge

20
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:41,400
No. We're talking about
the weather now

21
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:44,000
You can't lump
the two issues together

22
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:47,800
You must get it done nonetheless

23
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:51,600
It's an order from Marquis
who wants it done for Her Highness

24
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:54,000
You've got to find a way about it

25
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:58,000
How about this?
I practically grew up on medicine

26
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:01,000
You could say I have some knowledge
on herbal medicine

27
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:04,000
Now, why do peach blossoms
grow in the south?

28
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:06,000
They dread the cold, that's why!

29
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:10,800
-I know that too!
-Let me finish talking

30
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:16,600
But if we raise the temperature
in the peach blossom woods,

31
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:19,600
the flowers may just bloom
before their time, right?

32
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:24,200
How are we going to raise
the temperature in the woods?

33
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:28,800
Follow my instructions and
get everyone to do his bit

34
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:38,600
-Your Excellency
-How is it coming along?

35
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:41,600
It'll be done shortly and
Your Excellency will do the honours

36
00:03:41,600 --> 00:03:44,600
-Are you ready?
-Yes, we are

37
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:46,400
Your Excellency,
please light the fire

38
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:54,600
Pass on the torch

39
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:32,000
When will the peach blossoms bloom?

40
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:35,200
The fire has to burn for 16 hours
for a rise in temperature

41
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:37,200
And you'll see
the peach blossoms bloom

42
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:40,600
16 hours? That will be tomorrow.
Can we speed it up?

43
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:44,600
Your Excellency,
there is no deity in our midst

44
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:46,600
Are you one?

45
00:04:47,200 --> 00:04:50,400
Your Excellency,
tonight will be a crucial time

46
00:04:50,400 --> 00:04:52,800
The temperature will dip drastically
in the night,

47
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,800
so the flame must never die

48
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:58,600
All right. Bring me good tidings
tomorrow morning

49
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,600
-Miss Ma is here
-I see all of you are busy

50
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:08,600
-Will the peach blossoms bloom?
-Keep the woods warm and they will

51
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:12,600
It's Her Highness' wish

52
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:15,600
What a joke!
This is against the law of nature

53
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:17,600
What's more, she's only a princess

54
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:20,400
Her Highness certainly
doesn't have the powers

55
00:05:20,400 --> 00:05:24,600
But the culmination of our efforts,
sincerity and passion...

56
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:26,200
will move Heavens...

57
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:28,800
to hasten the blooming of
the peach blossoms

58
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:31,400
What's the purpose of
doing all this?

59
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:34,600
The peach blossoms will bring a smile
on Her Highness' face,

60
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:36,600
making our hard work worth the while

61
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:40,600
That's all?
To make Her Highness smile?

62
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:43,800
Of course! Her Highness is royalty

63
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:45,800
Her smile is worth
a thousand taels of gold

64
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:47,000
Silly!

65
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:58,600
It's snowing.
What shall we do?

66
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:04,000
Everyone, disperse!

67
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:06,200
Let's go home

68
00:06:08,200 --> 00:06:11,600
Lu, it's snowing heavily.
The torch has gone out

69
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:15,000
I'll go home and
prepare a hot bath for you

70
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:19,600
Son, it's snowing heavily. I doubt
the peach blossoms will bloom

71
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:22,200
Let's go home.
Get going

72
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:25,200
The snowflakes are falling
fast and furious

73
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:28,600
I'll go home and
run a hot bath for you

74
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:53,200
O heavens!

75
00:06:54,200 --> 00:06:55,200
Idiot!

76
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:48,200
Don't you threaten us.
We'll fight it out with you!

77
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:16,200
This can't be happening!

78
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:23,600
This can't be happening!

79
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:27,200
This can't be happening!

80
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,200
Fu!

81
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:41,600
Fu...
Look at that!

82
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:45,200
The flowers have bloomed!

83
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:55,600
Lu! Lu!

84
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:57,600
Check this out!

85
00:09:57,600 --> 00:10:00,600
The peach blossoms have bloomed!

86
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:13,600
The flowers have bloomed

87
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:18,200
How wonderful!

88
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:27,600
-Am I dreaming?
-No, Your Highness

89
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:32,200
I also thought I was in a dream when
I woke up to see the peach blossoms

90
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:37,600
Your Highness, allow me.
When the peach blossoms bloom...

91
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:41,800
Allow me, Your Highness.
Look at the beautiful flowers

92
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:46,200
This way, Your Highness

93
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:48,600
I merely made a casual remark
but you've made my wish come true

94
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:51,200
Did Shi Yaoqian and Marquis make
life difficult for you?

95
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:54,200
Not at all.
We just had to use our brains

96
00:10:55,800 --> 00:10:58,800
Your Highness, see how lovely
the flowers are

97
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:02,600
Here, see how lovely the flowers are

98
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:06,600
I'd better not make special requests
before the marquis in future

99
00:11:07,280 --> 00:11:11,200
Don't worry. We will make everything
possible for you

100
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:14,600
Feel free to make known your requests

101
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:20,280
Who'd believe the peach blossoms will
bloom against a snow landscape?

102
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:25,000
I'll make special mention of three
rare talents before His Majesty

103
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:30,000
Your Highness called us rare talents?

104
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:32,320
You flatter us

105
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:36,600
You must have put in a lot of effort
to create such a lovely scenery

106
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:40,200
Seriously, credit doesn't just go
to the three of us

107
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:42,200
Everyone else also
played a part in it

108
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:45,600
To be honest, I didn't think
Shou's method would work

109
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:48,000
In the end, it did
beyond expectations!

110
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:51,600
He's a genius.
No, we're all geniuses

111
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:56,600
It'll be the imperial court's loss
not to employ driven talents like you

112
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:58,200
That's true

113
00:11:58,600 --> 00:12:02,600
Please don't say that.
It's all about right timing

114
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:07,720
My mother says peach blossoms
are a gift from Heaven

115
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:10,200
We should take some home
as an offering to the gods

116
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:15,000
My mother also said
drinking peach blossom wine...

117
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:18,200
will give one luck in love and
release one from love troubles

118
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:21,600
Let's pluck a few stalks

119
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:27,600
Let's be going

120
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:32,600
While she's admiring the flowers,
here you are plucking them

121
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:34,200
You're being a wet blanket

122
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:36,080
What's that about?

123
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:41,000
The only spoilsport around is
none other than Spicy Woman!

124
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:45,200
The mention of her makes me mad.
She wrote off our idea

125
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:50,000
Now, what will she say if she sees
the flowers in full bloom?

126
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:52,600
She'll feel sore, what else!

127
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:56,200
Come on, Spicy Woman is quite pitiful

128
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:59,800
She only gets to see ugly things

129
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:03,600
For one, she's not here to witness
the beauty of the peach blossoms

130
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:05,600
Don't you feel sorry for her?

131
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:09,600
Why do you say that about Miss Ma?
She's a nice lady

132
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:13,600
Miss Ma looks down on us

133
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:17,200
She finds the three of us incompetent

134
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:19,600
Don't take it to heart, Fu

135
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:24,000
I believe this episode
will change her mind about us

136
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:29,200
We've overcome great difficulties
to make the peach blossoms bloom

137
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:32,000
That proves we're no
less competent than her

138
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:37,800
Exactly! We'll gladly accept it
if she concedes defeat to us now

139
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:40,600
The peach blossoms and one's face
reflect each other's radiance

140
00:13:40,600 --> 00:13:43,600
I bet she's red-faced now!

141
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,200
Ma-gu!

142
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:09,600
Xiao-ma! Ma-gugu!

143
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:14,200
Miss Xiao-ma!

144
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,600
I heard you

145
00:14:19,200 --> 00:14:21,600
Must you react that way?
Do I look that awful?

146
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:24,000
You don't look that awful.
You look hideous!

147
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:28,600
I warned you against using your powers
but you never heeded my advice

148
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:32,200
Look at yourself.
It gets worse each time

149
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:35,600
So I look really awful

150
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:37,800
No, you don't.
You look just hideous

151
00:14:37,800 --> 00:14:41,600
Trust you to say that! If the peach
blossoms didn't bloom prematurely,

152
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:45,200
the Trio and the people of
Ping-an Town would suffer!

153
00:14:45,200 --> 00:14:48,000
Leave the mortals to settle
their own problems

154
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:50,000
Why use your powers?

155
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:53,600
As if the peach blossoms would bloom
without my powers

156
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:59,000
In any case, my freckles will
go away in two or three days

157
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:05,200
What's your point now?

158
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:07,000
Are you keeping something from me?

159
00:15:18,280 --> 00:15:21,800
You're keeping something from me!
Look at your eyebrows!

160
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:24,600
They'll go up each time
you tell a lie!

161
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:27,600
-Tell me!
-All right, I'll tell you

162
00:15:28,600 --> 00:15:33,000
It'll take more than 3 days
for your face to be restored

163
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:35,000
How come?

164
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:39,000
That's only applicable to the first
offence but not subsequent ones

165
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:43,000
Drats! Why didn't you
tell me that before?

166
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:47,600
I did warn you against using
your powers indiscriminately

167
00:15:47,600 --> 00:15:50,000
What could I do
if my words fell on deaf ears?

168
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:53,600
Zhang Guolao, you'd better give me
all the rules in one breath!

169
00:15:53,600 --> 00:15:58,000
Had I known, I wouldn't have
sacrificed my face for those three

170
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:01,600
Fret not. I've come prepared.
Look at what I've got

171
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:05,600
I got these three drops of sweet dew
from Little Dragon Girl

172
00:16:06,800 --> 00:16:12,400
And these are three beauty pearls
from Jade Flower Fairy of Jasper Pool

173
00:16:12,400 --> 00:16:16,600
Grind the pearls into powder and
mix it with the sweet dew

174
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:18,600
Use it twice a day,
morning and night

175
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:21,600
Apply it on your face with
some clear water

176
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:27,400
It's guaranteed to restore your looks
and youth in 3 days

177
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:30,000
-Will it work?
-You bet

178
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:34,600
This is Weaving Maid's beauty secret

179
00:16:34,600 --> 00:16:38,600
She'll apply it on her face before
she meets Cowherd-Boy every year

180
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:41,000
I've used it only once and
see how good my skin is

181
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:43,000
All right, I'll give it a try

182
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:46,200
If it doesn't work,
I'll cut off your beard!

183
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:50,600
You're getting more like a shrew.
No wonder they call you Spicy Woman

184
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:54,200
-Even you're teasing me!
-Stay still. You look really old

185
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:56,600
Use the products faithfully and
recommend them to friends

186
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:59,600
Guolao is not old (lao)

187
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:02,400
Stupid Zhang Guolao!

188
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:17,600
His Lordship is painting

189
00:17:17,600 --> 00:17:19,200
Is that Magistrate Shi?

190
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:24,600
-Your Lordship...
-This painting is for Her Highness

191
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:26,600
That's a painting of peach blossoms

192
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:29,600
What do you think of my painting?

193
00:17:29,600 --> 00:17:32,200
-Lovely!
-You sounded contrived

194
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:35,000
Where did you get
the peach blossoms from?

195
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:37,600
-From the peach blossom woods
-They did it?

196
00:17:37,600 --> 00:17:41,600
Yes, they did.
Every branch gave bloom

197
00:17:42,600 --> 00:17:46,200
The trees actually bloomed
in this wintry weather

198
00:17:46,400 --> 00:17:48,600
Well done!
Get my horse ready

199
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:51,200
I must deliver the good news
to Her Highness personally

200
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:53,600
There is no need to, Your Lordship

201
00:17:53,800 --> 00:17:58,200
Why not? You must have told her
the news, haven't you?

202
00:17:59,200 --> 00:18:01,000
Aren't you fast
at ingratiating yourself

203
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:10,600
Your Lordship, that Her Highness
has admired the peach blossoms...

204
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:13,600
is the work of Wei Delu and his gang

205
00:18:13,800 --> 00:18:16,200
I beg your pardon, Your Lordship

206
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:21,200
Chen Daqi, you will plan
a peach blossom banquet

207
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:24,600
The three of them shall be invited

208
00:18:24,800 --> 00:18:28,200
They managed to make the flowers
bloom in the thick snow...

209
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:30,000
to please her Highness

210
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:33,000
That was quite a feat.
I shall reward them handsomely

211
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:34,000
Yes

212
00:18:34,800 --> 00:18:36,720
-Take your leave
-Yes, Your Lordship

213
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:53,000
Ouyang Xiaotian has invited us to
the peach blossom banquet

214
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:55,000
Doesn't that look good on us?

215
00:18:55,200 --> 00:19:00,000
Let's see who'd dare despise
and bully us again

216
00:19:02,400 --> 00:19:08,200
The peach blossom banquet hosted by
Ouyang Xiaotian will be a grand event

217
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:10,600
It's not everyday that
commoners get invited

218
00:19:10,600 --> 00:19:14,600
I bet a lavish spread awaits us.
We're in for a treat!

219
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:20,000
I hope he'll reward me
at the banquet

220
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:24,000
You may even get a promotion
and a wage increment

221
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:28,200
I want greater authority to deal with
Shi Yaoqian and Spicy Woman

222
00:19:29,400 --> 00:19:33,000
I only ask that I'll be presented
with a reward of 100 taels of gold

223
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:36,000
I have a simpler wish

224
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:39,600
I hope to enjoy the Emperor's Banquet

225
00:19:39,600 --> 00:19:42,000
That will make me a contented man

226
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:45,200
Will Ma Ruyi let you have your way?

227
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:49,200
That reminds me. We've not seen her
for days. Where has she gone to?

228
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:50,200
Who cares?

229
00:19:50,200 --> 00:19:51,400
Your Lordship

230
00:19:51,400 --> 00:19:56,400
Your Lordship, I've done what
you instructed me to do

231
00:19:56,800 --> 00:19:58,200
What's that in your hands?

232
00:19:58,200 --> 00:20:00,600
-It's Dew of Unrestrained Lust
-What does it do?

233
00:20:00,800 --> 00:20:06,200
Wei Delu and gang hold their liquor
well. They don't get drunk easily

234
00:20:06,200 --> 00:20:10,600
But just a few drops of
the scentless and tasteless dew...

235
00:20:10,600 --> 00:20:12,200
will turn things around

236
00:20:12,800 --> 00:20:16,800
Drink it and it'll make one lose
one's self-restraint

237
00:20:17,600 --> 00:20:19,720
Does Your Lordship get my point?

238
00:20:21,800 --> 00:20:24,600
Chen Daqi, good job

239
00:20:24,600 --> 00:20:26,200
Thank you, Your Lordship

240
00:20:27,320 --> 00:20:30,200
Even if I don't get
to kill you three,

241
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:32,800
this will appease me somewhat

242
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:37,600
This peach blossom banquet is held
in honour of Her Highness and...

243
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:40,800
in appreciation of what
the three of you have done

244
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:44,200
Please eat and drink
to your heart's content

245
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:45,600
Certainly

246
00:20:51,200 --> 00:20:53,200
Where is Miss Ma?

247
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:57,600
She has something to attend to,
so we'll take over her duties

248
00:20:58,400 --> 00:21:02,000
What a shame. I hear Miss Ma
holds her liquor well

249
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:04,400
It's a pity she's not here tonight

250
00:21:04,400 --> 00:21:07,800
Well, you shall drink
on her behalf then

251
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:14,000
Your wish is our command,
Your Lordship

252
00:21:17,600 --> 00:21:20,600
Do help yourself to the wine

253
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:24,600
Cheers

254
00:21:37,800 --> 00:21:39,600
Excellent wine

255
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:43,600
We've had the wine.
What entertainment follows?

256
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:46,600
Absolutely!
It's about to begin

257
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:49,400
Make it soon.
I'm getting impatient

258
00:21:53,800 --> 00:21:55,000
He's already drunk?

259
00:21:56,200 --> 00:21:59,200
Who are you?
Are you the guest performer?

260
00:21:59,600 --> 00:22:04,400
Are you? Don't talk so much
or you'll get it from me!

261
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:11,800
He's drunk.
But the rest of us aren't

262
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:17,000
He's the poorest drinker
among the three of us

263
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:19,800
That crazy and idiotic
good-for-nothing!

264
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:22,600
Look at him.
Isn't he just useless?

265
00:22:22,600 --> 00:22:25,600
Just one cup and he's dead drunk

266
00:22:25,800 --> 00:22:30,600
You wretched official!
Would we get drunk before you do?

267
00:22:30,600 --> 00:22:31,800
Pardon me?!

268
00:22:31,800 --> 00:22:35,400
I'm telling the truth.
You are Shi Yaoqian

269
00:22:35,800 --> 00:22:38,200
You're only good at
fleecing the people!

270
00:22:38,200 --> 00:22:40,000
That's slander!

271
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:43,200
I'm only stating facts

272
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:52,000
She's very pretty

273
00:22:52,200 --> 00:22:57,600
-Is she the one I like...
-No, not her

274
00:22:57,600 --> 00:22:59,200
You've got the wrong person

275
00:22:59,200 --> 00:23:02,200
It's him!
You like fat women

276
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:06,200
That's right.
What's the name again?

277
00:23:06,200 --> 00:23:08,000
Feifei!

278
00:23:10,400 --> 00:23:12,000
Feifei...

279
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:14,600
What are you doing?

280
00:23:15,200 --> 00:23:17,000
What are you doing?

281
00:23:18,800 --> 00:23:20,000
What are you doing?

282
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:23,000
It's all right that
you're a prostitute

283
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:25,600
Will you keep me company tonight?

284
00:23:26,000 --> 00:23:29,600
Fu, kiss him!
Kiss him!

285
00:23:39,200 --> 00:23:41,000
This is scandalous!

286
00:24:04,600 --> 00:24:08,200
Three grown men locked in arms
in broad daylight! Preposterous!

287
00:24:08,200 --> 00:24:11,600
-It's none of your business
-Stop looking. Go away!

288
00:24:31,000 --> 00:24:33,600
We walked into a trap last night

289
00:24:33,600 --> 00:24:38,000
That rogue of a Ouyang Xiaotian
had our wine spiked

290
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:40,800
I merely had one sip of the wine

291
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:44,600
-I recall it now! You!
-What?

292
00:24:44,800 --> 00:24:49,000
-You're in trouble
-What did I do?

293
00:24:49,000 --> 00:24:51,600
Talk! What did I do?

294
00:24:51,800 --> 00:24:54,200
-You were a disgrace!
-What do you mean?

295
00:24:54,600 --> 00:24:56,600
-I recall it now
-You tell him

296
00:24:56,600 --> 00:24:59,200
What did you recall?
Tell me

297
00:24:59,200 --> 00:25:01,200
-Trust you to do that
-What did I do?

298
00:25:01,200 --> 00:25:06,600
In the presence of everyone, you...
I didn't have a good view of it

299
00:25:06,600 --> 00:25:10,000
-Then I heard the sound of water
-The sound of water?

300
00:25:10,000 --> 00:25:13,400
-Is he telling the truth?
-You even did this

301
00:25:15,000 --> 00:25:17,200
Did that really happen?

302
00:25:17,200 --> 00:25:20,600
You mean I peed in public?!

303
00:25:21,800 --> 00:25:25,000
-That can't be true!
-You had no sense of dignity

304
00:25:28,000 --> 00:25:32,000
-Don't come near me
-What did I do?

305
00:25:34,200 --> 00:25:37,800
You... Yes! You kept wanting
to write a poem!

306
00:25:37,800 --> 00:25:41,800
-That's a relief
-You're in trouble!

307
00:25:41,800 --> 00:25:43,600
I'm in trouble?
What did I do?

308
00:25:43,600 --> 00:25:46,400
-Right before Her Highness, you...
-Yes, that's right!

309
00:25:46,400 --> 00:25:48,200
What did I do?

310
00:25:48,200 --> 00:25:51,400
You ripped the clothes off
the maid!

311
00:25:52,000 --> 00:25:54,800
You even wrote a poem on her body

312
00:25:54,800 --> 00:25:58,600
You even wrote
on the front of her body!

313
00:26:00,200 --> 00:26:03,600
-There is ink on your lips
-Let me see your tongue

314
00:26:04,600 --> 00:26:06,600
-You're cheap!
-I still see ink

315
00:26:06,600 --> 00:26:10,200
-You're cheap!
-You're a disgrace

316
00:26:11,800 --> 00:26:14,600
I recall it now.
He...

317
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:18,800
-I recall it too
-What did I do?

318
00:26:18,800 --> 00:26:21,600
-What did I do?
-You did worse

319
00:26:21,600 --> 00:26:24,200
-You were more shameless than us
-How so?

320
00:26:24,200 --> 00:26:26,200
You kissed that person!

321
00:26:27,200 --> 00:26:30,400
I kissed the princess?
That's nice!

322
00:26:30,400 --> 00:26:32,200
No? Who was it?

323
00:26:33,200 --> 00:26:35,200
He kissed Shi Yaoqian!

324
00:26:36,400 --> 00:26:38,600
Shi Yaoqian?!

325
00:26:44,200 --> 00:26:46,200
Why did you slap us?

326
00:26:46,200 --> 00:26:48,200
You people are despicable,
shameless and lowdown!

327
00:26:48,200 --> 00:26:52,200
Are you awake yet?
I very much doubt so

328
00:26:52,200 --> 00:26:55,200
I wash my hands of you!
You're on your own now

329
00:26:55,200 --> 00:26:58,600
You shall be deprived of blessings,
officialdom and longevity!

330
00:27:01,200 --> 00:27:03,200
It puzzles me greatly

331
00:27:03,200 --> 00:27:06,200
Am I destined to be down on my luck?

332
00:27:06,200 --> 00:27:10,200
Why do the misfortunes that
befall on me never happen to others?

333
00:27:10,320 --> 00:27:14,200
My parents abandoned me and everyone
in this town calls me a vermin

334
00:27:14,400 --> 00:27:18,600
Was I a crow in my past life?
Is that why I'm so unwelcome?

335
00:27:19,000 --> 00:27:23,200
Talk to me!
Why won't you answer me?

336
00:27:33,200 --> 00:27:36,600
Tortoise, did you just laugh at me?

337
00:27:38,000 --> 00:27:40,200
Are you some spirit?

338
00:27:42,200 --> 00:27:47,600
No way! No way can your voice
sound so clear and crisp

339
00:28:06,400 --> 00:28:07,600
You are?

340
00:28:07,720 --> 00:28:13,200
I'm sorry I overheard
your conversation with the tortoise

341
00:28:13,200 --> 00:28:15,600
-It's all right
-I didn't do it on purpose

342
00:28:15,600 --> 00:28:18,200
-It's all right
-I got here long ago

343
00:28:18,200 --> 00:28:20,600
-It's all right
-You didn't see me

344
00:28:20,600 --> 00:28:23,600
-It's really all right
-I came to clean the idols

345
00:28:25,000 --> 00:28:30,600
You're a devout believer. The three
idols have long been forgotten

346
00:28:31,400 --> 00:28:37,000
My father told me this temple used
to be packed with devotees

347
00:28:37,000 --> 00:28:40,600
Many people came here to pray and
had their prayers answered

348
00:28:41,000 --> 00:28:45,800
I heard about that too,
but those days are in the past

349
00:28:46,000 --> 00:28:48,600
So why are you still so devout?

350
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:51,600
My family lives in the village
right ahead

351
00:28:51,600 --> 00:28:55,600
My sister and I will come here
to clean the idols and thank them...

352
00:28:55,600 --> 00:28:57,200
on our birthdays every year

353
00:28:58,200 --> 00:29:02,200
You're so kind.
The three idiots...

354
00:29:02,600 --> 00:29:06,600
I mean, fortunes are going to change
for the three deities

355
00:29:07,400 --> 00:29:10,000
This was my father's dying wish

356
00:29:10,000 --> 00:29:14,600
Life was hard for my father
when he was little

357
00:29:14,600 --> 00:29:18,600
Then he came to this temple
to offer prayers to the three deities

358
00:29:18,600 --> 00:29:20,600
His prayers were answered!

359
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:23,400
What happened next?

360
00:29:23,600 --> 00:29:26,800
My father married my mother and
had me and my sister

361
00:29:27,000 --> 00:29:31,200
He said he was most grateful
to have two filial daughters

362
00:29:31,400 --> 00:29:33,200
I see

363
00:29:35,200 --> 00:29:38,000
Miss, you're a very candid person

364
00:29:38,400 --> 00:29:44,000
You've shared so much about your
family though we'd never met before

365
00:29:44,000 --> 00:29:46,200
That's because I think
you're a good man

366
00:29:46,400 --> 00:29:49,200
I... I'm a good man?

367
00:29:50,400 --> 00:29:52,200
Do I look like one?

368
00:29:52,600 --> 00:29:55,000
Yes, you do! I heard you just now

369
00:29:55,000 --> 00:29:58,600
You're a good man who treasures
friendship and loyalty

370
00:29:58,600 --> 00:30:00,200
You really think so?

371
00:30:02,000 --> 00:30:03,600
I'm so happy!

372
00:30:05,280 --> 00:30:07,200
I'm Wu Fuqi

373
00:30:07,200 --> 00:30:11,600
Wu Fuqi? I'm sure it's a blessing
(fu qi) to be your friend

374
00:30:11,600 --> 00:30:13,200
If only that were true...

375
00:30:15,200 --> 00:30:17,000
But that's not the case

376
00:30:18,000 --> 00:30:20,000
You seem troubled

377
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:24,600
Brother Fuqi, I'm not a smart person.
I tend to speak my mind

378
00:30:24,600 --> 00:30:26,200
Don't hold it against me

379
00:30:26,200 --> 00:30:31,000
Girls like you aren't scheming.
You're a good person

380
00:30:31,200 --> 00:30:33,600
-You think so?
-Yes

381
00:30:33,600 --> 00:30:37,600
You call me Brother Fuqi and
you're willing to talk to me

382
00:30:37,600 --> 00:30:39,200
That's already hard to come by

383
00:30:39,200 --> 00:30:43,600
I'll be honest with you. Everyone
in Ping-an Town looks down on me

384
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:48,200
Those people don't know any better.
Don't be bothered by it

385
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:50,200
Yes! I agree with you

386
00:30:50,200 --> 00:30:53,480
-Those people are snobs
-Exactly

387
00:30:53,600 --> 00:30:56,200
Since they despise me,

388
00:30:56,200 --> 00:31:03,000
I shall achieve an earth-shaking feat
one day and they shall fear me!

389
00:31:03,200 --> 00:31:05,600
Why make everyone hold you in fear?

390
00:31:05,600 --> 00:31:08,000
Isn't it better if you're well-liked?

391
00:31:08,200 --> 00:31:11,600
Brother Fuqi, stop entertaining
those thoughts, all right?

392
00:31:12,200 --> 00:31:13,200
All right

393
00:31:20,200 --> 00:31:22,200
By the way, what's your name?

394
00:31:22,200 --> 00:31:25,000
Yes, I forgot to give you my name.
I'm Yu Shuangxi

395
00:31:25,200 --> 00:31:28,200
Yu Shuangxi?
That's a nice name

396
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:32,000
You have a nice laughter

397
00:31:33,400 --> 00:31:38,200
Brother Fuqi, we've reached my house.
Do stay for dinner

398
00:31:39,000 --> 00:31:40,200
Dinner?

399
00:31:41,200 --> 00:31:45,000
Where are your brains?
You actually brought a stranger home

400
00:31:45,600 --> 00:31:48,000
Sis, Brother Fuqi is a good man

401
00:31:48,000 --> 00:31:52,000
Brother Fuqi in our house means
blessings (fu qi) have come to us

402
00:31:52,320 --> 00:31:54,480
If only it were so!

403
00:31:55,720 --> 00:32:00,400
He's part of the infamous
three vermins of Ping-an Town

404
00:32:00,400 --> 00:32:04,600
Since the day he was born,
Ping-an Town has had no peace

405
00:32:04,600 --> 00:32:06,600
That chap is a rogue

406
00:32:06,600 --> 00:32:07,600
Really?

407
00:32:07,600 --> 00:32:12,200
He was in cahoots
with Joined Brow, that bandit

408
00:32:12,600 --> 00:32:15,200
-Really?
-You don't believe me?

409
00:32:15,200 --> 00:32:18,600
I am a good judge of character

410
00:32:18,600 --> 00:32:22,200
One look at him and
I know he is no decent soul

411
00:32:22,200 --> 00:32:25,480
But Brother Fuqi isn't in the least
like you made him out to be

412
00:32:25,480 --> 00:32:26,600
What?

413
00:32:26,600 --> 00:32:29,600
Sis, no one is a saint.
We all make mistakes

414
00:32:29,600 --> 00:32:32,800
-Besides...
-Stop defending him

415
00:32:33,200 --> 00:32:35,600
Fix dinner soon so that
he'll leave sooner

416
00:32:36,200 --> 00:32:40,200
Sis, on what basis do you judge
a person's character?

417
00:32:41,000 --> 00:32:44,200
I judge a person with my eyes.
I can't use my nose, can I?

418
00:32:44,200 --> 00:32:45,600
You can be so dumb

419
00:32:46,000 --> 00:32:49,600
But I feel we read a person's
character with our heart

420
00:32:49,600 --> 00:32:52,200
What nonsense is that?
I don't get you

421
00:32:56,200 --> 00:33:00,200
Miss Yu, it's getting late.
I should be going

422
00:33:00,200 --> 00:33:04,200
Oh, we shan't keep you then.
Goodbye

423
00:33:04,200 --> 00:33:06,600
Brother Fuqi, have dinner first

424
00:33:08,000 --> 00:33:11,800
Didn't he say it was getting late?

425
00:33:12,000 --> 00:33:14,600
Have a safe journey back

426
00:33:14,600 --> 00:33:18,200
Pardon my sister
for being a poor host

427
00:33:18,400 --> 00:33:23,200
It's not that bad.
Miss Yu, I'll stay

428
00:33:23,200 --> 00:33:25,600
Let me know if I can help in any way

429
00:33:26,400 --> 00:33:30,600
No need. They're all chores
for the womenfolk

430
00:33:30,600 --> 00:33:32,200
You won't be of any help

431
00:33:34,000 --> 00:33:36,600
Big Sister Yu, you've got
such nimble fingers

432
00:33:36,600 --> 00:33:39,000
That's a lovely quilted blanket

433
00:33:39,000 --> 00:33:42,600
Don't be on such
affectionate terms with me

434
00:33:42,600 --> 00:33:44,600
What I'm doing here is
nothing extraordinary

435
00:33:44,600 --> 00:33:50,000
You can't say that. Two persons can
handle the same chore differently

436
00:33:50,000 --> 00:33:53,000
-It's true
-Don't try to sweet-talk me

437
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:57,200
Had sweet-nothings worked on me,
I'd have got married long ago

438
00:33:57,400 --> 00:34:00,600
Sis, that's not a nice thing to say

439
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:05,200
It's all right. Big Sister Yu is
the straight-talking sort

440
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:08,600
One look at her face and I know
she's a magnanimous person

441
00:34:08,600 --> 00:34:11,000
No wonder she does a great job
with the blanket

442
00:34:11,000 --> 00:34:14,000
The heart affects what the hands do

443
00:34:22,800 --> 00:34:25,600
-Miss Shuangxi, let me help you
-No need

444
00:34:25,600 --> 00:34:29,200
It's all right. I'm good at this.
Take a break

445
00:34:30,200 --> 00:34:32,000
-Thank you
-Take a break

446
00:34:49,000 --> 00:34:50,200
Are you all right?

447
00:34:51,200 --> 00:34:52,200
I'm fine

448
00:34:53,200 --> 00:34:55,200
Why is there so much smoke?

449
00:34:55,200 --> 00:34:57,200
Don't worry. Everything's fine

450
00:35:06,000 --> 00:35:09,600
Wu Fuqi, what's with you? I've been
working on the blanket for 3 months!

451
00:35:20,200 --> 00:35:23,000
My blanket, Wu Fuqi!

452
00:35:23,000 --> 00:35:24,400
Wait!

453
00:35:27,400 --> 00:35:30,200
I've spent 3 months on this blanket!

454
00:35:30,200 --> 00:35:32,800
I'm sorry, Sister Daxi

455
00:35:34,200 --> 00:35:36,000
My tablet for Kitchen God!

456
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:40,200
I'm sorry!

457
00:35:43,400 --> 00:35:46,600
-Don't hit me. I'm sorry!
-Stop it, Sis. You'd better go

458
00:35:46,600 --> 00:35:47,600
Bye!

459
00:36:05,400 --> 00:36:08,600
Why is life so hard for us?

460
00:36:09,800 --> 00:36:11,600
Our parents died early and...

461
00:36:11,600 --> 00:36:13,600
left us with a mountain of debts

462
00:36:13,720 --> 00:36:17,200
Good thing we still have each other

463
00:36:18,200 --> 00:36:21,000
Sis, I've always been grateful to you

464
00:36:22,000 --> 00:36:25,000
Come on, what's that between sisters?

465
00:36:27,600 --> 00:36:31,400
But I must say
I've sacrificed a lot for you

466
00:36:32,800 --> 00:36:37,200
When we were little, I'd always
let you have the best food

467
00:36:37,600 --> 00:36:41,200
Each time we had a meal,
I'd always get pricked by fish bones

468
00:36:42,200 --> 00:36:46,600
Each time you ran into danger,
I'd be there to get you out of it

469
00:36:47,200 --> 00:36:51,400
Sis, I know no one treats me better
than you do

470
00:36:51,400 --> 00:36:54,600
But you only show kindness to others

471
00:36:55,200 --> 00:36:59,000
We're living in chaotic times

472
00:36:59,000 --> 00:37:03,000
But you actually brought a man
whom we'd never met home

473
00:37:03,200 --> 00:37:05,800
But I sense that Brother Fuqi
is a good man

474
00:37:06,000 --> 00:37:11,000
I'm just afraid you'll be bullied
if I'm no longer around

475
00:37:11,200 --> 00:37:15,200
We're blood sisters.
We will never be separated

476
00:37:19,800 --> 00:37:21,200
Don't be too idealistic

477
00:37:21,400 --> 00:37:26,600
In order to pay for
Father's funeral three years ago,

478
00:37:26,600 --> 00:37:29,200
I sold myself to the Mei family

479
00:37:29,800 --> 00:37:32,800
Now that the three years of mourning
will be coming to an end,

480
00:37:32,800 --> 00:37:35,600
I'll have to work there
as a maid very soon

481
00:37:36,000 --> 00:37:40,600
Don't go, Sis.
I'll miss you

482
00:37:41,000 --> 00:37:44,200
Silly girl, I'll miss you too

483
00:37:45,200 --> 00:37:49,400
I'm worried about
leaving you all alone here

484
00:37:52,000 --> 00:37:57,200
Don't worry about me, Sis.
I'll take good care of myself

485
00:38:04,000 --> 00:38:08,600
Don't leave, Sis...

486
00:38:36,600 --> 00:38:39,000
Uncle, are you all right?

487
00:38:39,200 --> 00:38:43,600
Granny, Father, Mother, come up here!
Uncle has hurt himself again

488
00:38:44,600 --> 00:38:48,600
Shou, what happened?

489
00:38:48,600 --> 00:38:53,000
Shou, what's wrong?
Don't frighten me

490
00:38:53,600 --> 00:38:56,800
You're a grown-up. You should watch
where you were going

491
00:38:59,200 --> 00:39:03,000
My fault. Still groggy from sleep,
I slipped and fell

492
00:39:03,200 --> 00:39:05,200
That was a hard fall

493
00:39:05,400 --> 00:39:07,600
Let's help him to his bed

494
00:39:17,400 --> 00:39:19,600
Shou, are you all right?

495
00:39:20,200 --> 00:39:22,000
My back hurts terribly

496
00:39:22,200 --> 00:39:25,600
My dear brother, is there
some hex over you?

497
00:39:25,600 --> 00:39:30,200
You're either falling down or
hurting somewhere in your body

498
00:39:30,200 --> 00:39:33,200
In case you don't know,
we're suffering with you

499
00:39:33,600 --> 00:39:35,600
It's probably his fate

500
00:39:35,600 --> 00:39:39,600
Let's get him a wife
to change his fortunes

501
00:39:39,600 --> 00:39:42,600
For all we know, the marriage
will heal him of all ailments

502
00:39:42,600 --> 00:39:44,600
That's a good idea, Mother!

503
00:39:45,000 --> 00:39:47,000
Mother, must we do that?

504
00:39:48,200 --> 00:39:52,200
Which girl is good enough for Shou?

505
00:39:54,280 --> 00:39:59,000
It won't be easy to find Shou a wife

506
00:39:59,200 --> 00:40:01,600
Will it be that difficult?

507
00:40:02,000 --> 00:40:04,600
You don't know, Mother

508
00:40:04,600 --> 00:40:07,600
There are more men than women
in Ping-an Town

509
00:40:08,200 --> 00:40:11,600
It's said the girls are very picky

510
00:40:11,600 --> 00:40:16,000
What's more, there are 3 types of men
whom they won't marry

511
00:40:16,200 --> 00:40:17,600
What's that?

512
00:40:19,200 --> 00:40:24,600
One, they won't marry
the impoverished or beggars

513
00:40:26,600 --> 00:40:30,600
Our family may not be
exactly distinguished,

514
00:40:30,600 --> 00:40:34,200
but we're well-known
here in Ping-an Town

515
00:40:34,200 --> 00:40:36,800
So that's not a concern

516
00:40:38,200 --> 00:40:43,600
Mother, the second category is
made up of the down-and-out and boors

517
00:40:45,000 --> 00:40:49,200
Shou is refined and well-mannered

518
00:40:49,200 --> 00:40:52,600
That's not a concern either

519
00:40:53,000 --> 00:40:58,200
The third category comprises
the three vermins of this town

520
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:03,600
Mother, Shou does fall into
that category

521
00:41:05,800 --> 00:41:10,000
That means no decent girls for Shou.
What shall we do now?

522
00:41:11,200 --> 00:41:13,600
Don't we have a problem at hand?

523
00:41:24,600 --> 00:41:26,600
Got it!

524
00:41:28,000 --> 00:41:35,200
Mother, do you remember paying for
a coffin for a farmer 3 years ago?

525
00:41:37,000 --> 00:41:38,600
His daughter signed a contract stating
she'd be sold into our family...

526
00:41:38,600 --> 00:41:47,200
once the mourning period is over

527
00:41:48,200 --> 00:41:53,600
Yes, I forgot about that!
Let's take her as Shou's wife

528
00:41:55,000 --> 00:41:57,600
Brother Fuqi, sorry to trouble you
all the time

529
00:41:57,600 --> 00:42:00,800
Don't say that. The baskets are
too heavy for a girl

530
00:42:01,000 --> 00:42:04,400
That can't be helped.
We're poor folks. I'm used to it

531
00:42:12,600 --> 00:42:16,200
Big Mouth Su, long time no see!
Has business been slack?

532
00:42:16,200 --> 00:42:18,200
Here to have a chat with Sister Daxi?

533
00:42:18,800 --> 00:42:26,000
I'll have you know all the marriages
in Ping-an Town are arranged by me

534
00:42:29,200 --> 00:42:31,600
Are you here to arrange a match
for Sister Daxi?

535
00:42:32,280 --> 00:42:37,600
I'm here to send betrothal gifts and
money for your buddy, Mei Shouquan!

536
00:42:38,200 --> 00:42:40,200
Send betrothal gifts and money?!

537
00:42:42,000 --> 00:42:45,000
Big Mouth, are you sure?

538
00:42:45,000 --> 00:42:49,800
Sister Daxi is older than my buddy!
How can you arrange this match!

539
00:42:49,800 --> 00:42:51,600
Are you right in the mind?

540
00:42:52,000 --> 00:42:55,200
You're the one who's got it wrong

541
00:42:55,200 --> 00:42:59,000
The match isn't for
the older one in the house

542
00:42:59,000 --> 00:43:03,720
So who will be the bride?
It'll be the younger one here

543
00:43:05,200 --> 00:43:07,600
-She?
-Me?

544
00:43:07,600 --> 00:43:09,600
That's right.
It's you

545
00:43:11,200 --> 00:43:15,000
Sis, what is going on?

546
00:43:16,200 --> 00:43:21,600
Madam Mei has this match arranged
to change her son's fortunes

547
00:43:22,000 --> 00:43:26,000
If you marry into the family,
I won't have to be their maid

548
00:43:26,200 --> 00:43:28,600
They've even sent
the gifts and money over

549
00:43:28,600 --> 00:43:32,600
I won't hear of it.
I'm not getting married

550
00:43:32,800 --> 00:43:35,600
It's a good match.
Just say yes

551
00:43:35,600 --> 00:43:40,400
My foot! How can you force her
to get married, Big Mouth?

552
00:43:40,800 --> 00:43:46,000
They owe the family money and
have signed the contract

553
00:43:46,000 --> 00:43:49,600
The family has shown mercy
by offering this match

554
00:43:49,600 --> 00:43:52,600
She'll be their daughter-in-law,
not their maid!

555
00:43:52,800 --> 00:43:57,400
Big Mouth Su, I beg to differ. I'm
the one who owes the family money

556
00:43:57,400 --> 00:43:59,800
How can they force my sister's hand?

557
00:43:59,800 --> 00:44:00,800
Exactly!

558
00:44:01,000 --> 00:44:05,200
You're the one in debt.
Who are you to talk terms?

559
00:44:05,200 --> 00:44:10,200
Besides, the one in debt
is beholden to the lender

560
00:44:10,200 --> 00:44:13,800
Surely you understand that?

561
00:44:13,800 --> 00:44:16,200
I'm sure you do.
Move aside

562
00:44:18,800 --> 00:44:23,200
Just get ready to marry into
the Mei family. I'm off

563
00:44:26,800 --> 00:44:28,200
To heck with you!

564
00:44:29,200 --> 00:44:31,600
Sis, what shall we do?

565
00:44:32,200 --> 00:44:36,200
-I'm at a loss myself!
-How could they do that to you?

566
00:44:43,000 --> 00:44:45,000
Subtitled by A Han


